<%- include("../partials/head") %>
<section class="section"><div class="container legal">
<h1>Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated: <%= new Date().getFullYear() %></p>
<h2>Cancellation</h2>
<p>All plans (RegData API and tools) are prepaid and never renew automatically, so there is nothing to cancel. If you don't buy again, your account returns to the Free plan at the end of the period.</p>
<h2>Refunds</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>7-day money-back guarantee:</strong> if you're not happy, ask within 7 days of your first payment for a full refund.</li>
  <li>Yearly plans cancelled after 7 days can be refunded for the unused whole months, minus payment gateway charges.</li>
  <li>For the RegData API, refunds within 7 days are available if you have used less than 10% of the plan's monthly calls.</li>
  <li>GST charged is refunded with the plan price through a credit note.</li>
  <li>Approved refunds are returned to the original payment method within 5–7 working days.</li>
</ul>
<p>To request a refund, email <a href="mailto:<%= business.email %>"><%= business.email %></a> with your account email and payment ID.</p>
</div></section>
<%- include("../partials/foot") %>
